  1067                              <1> searchForPathspec:
  1068                              <1>     ;Now search the current directory for this filename
  1069                              <1>     ;Find first using SDA ffBlock
  1070                              <1>     ;If al = 0, we have final file name or directory name
  1071                              <1>     ;If al = \, we have subdirectory. NO WILDCARDS ALLOWED IF PATHSEP
