   224                              <1> ensureDiskValid:
   225                              <1> ;Do a media check, if need be to rebuild the DPB, do it!
   226                              <1> ;On entry: rbp = DPB (and working DPB = DPB)
   227                              <1> ;On exit: CF=NC => Passed, CF=CY => Fail
