    22 000077B6 7409                <1>     je .net
    23 000077B8 66F747430080        <1>     test word [rdi + cds.wFlags], cdsRedirDrive
    24 000077BE 7501                <1>     jnz .net ;Net with CDS
    25                              <1>     return  ;CF=NC => Not net
